%% current-gate breaks SmoothReveal. Shortest path (3 states):
%%   start under language check -> 2 tokens arrive (shown stays empty) -> gate accepts and reveals all 2 at once.
%% mutant-finish-ignores-tail breaks NoLossAtFinish. Shortest path (3 states):
