%% mutant-boundary-flush breaks BoundaryAfterQueue. Shortest path (3 states):
%%   start -> 1 word arrives into queue -> Boundary runs and flushes queue without waiting.
%% mutant-reject-commits breaks NoRejectedCommit. Shortest path (3 states):
%%   start under language check -> 1 word arrives -> gate rejects and commits the staged word.
%% mutant-no-age-cap breaks BoundedStall. Shortest path (5 states):
%%   start -> 8 tokens arrive -> reveals take 4, 2, 1 without draining expired tail steps, leaving stalled = 3 > 2.
%% current-lag breaks EveryWordVisible. Shortest path (2 states):
%%   one word arrives on an open line and is held out of the screen.
%% design-b breaks CommittedIsPrefixOfFinal. Shortest path (2 states):
%%   an open mark and word commit speculatively before a closing mark or underline decides them.
%% mutant-no-repair breaks NoUnfinalMark. Shortest path (2 states):
